<h2>Reset your password</h2>

<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>We received a request to reset your Netra password. Use the link below to set a new password:</p>

<p><a href="<%= @reset_url %>"><%= @reset_url %></a></p>

<p>Or copy this token into the reset form:</p>

<p style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block;"><%= @token %></p>

<p>This token expires in 1 hour.</p>

<p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

<p>— Netra</p>
